Golf

$cards
DECK 1 {SPADES, HEARTS, CLUBS, DIAMONDS}

$initial
DRAW 16 DEAL FOUNDATION
FOUNDATION 1 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 5 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 5 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 5 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 5 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 5 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 5 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 5 FACE_ALL

$moves
MOVE COLUMN FOUNDATION
OR
    DESTSRC Rank ascending
    DESTSRC Rank descending
    AND
        DEST Rank K
        SRC Rank 1
    AND
        DEST Rank 1
        SRC Rank K

$win
PILE ALL COLUMN Empty